{"parse":{"title":"个性/圣眷","pageid":9288,"revid":22589,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>圣眷</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.9C.A3.E7.9C.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"圣眷\"><b>圣眷</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 圣眷.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/hzhokq8lwjt5pj5v05qnosb5jo8ufzr.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/hzhokq8lwjt5pj5v05qnosb5jo8ufzr.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/hzhokq8lwjt5pj5v05qnosb5jo8ufzr.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />圣眷\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内所有己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">5</font>点。<br />✦对己方释放技能或触发效果后，使目标获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#f3c156\">1</font>点时，每点使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，每点使最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">8%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%89%E8%BE%89%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88%E2%80%9C%E5%9C%A3%E7%9C%B7%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/光辉术师“圣眷”\"><img alt=\"头像 光辉术师“圣眷”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4a/7btr97jt963hrfixyvbsvdhzh7u9n5l.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">光辉术师“圣眷”</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内所有己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">5</font>点。<br />✦对己方释放技能或触发效果后，使目标获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#f3c156\">1</font>点时，每点使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，每点使最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">16%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内所有己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">5</font>点。<br />✦对己方释放技能或触发效果后，使目标获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#f3c156\">1</font>点时，每点使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，每点使最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">16%</font>。战斗开始时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内所有己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">5</font>点。<br />✦对己方释放技能或触发效果后，使目标获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"